Z||000015||PBJ||06-14-2001||12:08 AM||||Hey there!  It was actually me you were speaking with (PBJ).  There are quite a few black GTs here.  Tonight - being Thursday - there will be a few of us Fiero owners going to a cruise night at the Westmount Mall parking lot at 6:00 p.m..  Feel free to show up and show off your car.  I guess Fieros are in need at these classic cruise nights because it is a special interest car.  Anyways, feel free to drop by Brianfinch and I'll have a look at your door-lock issue.  I'm a mechanic there so there it doesn't cost anything to look.  Us Fiero owners stick together so we'll get it fixed up for ya.  Just come by the shop - my name is Pete.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTPete.jpg"> ||||reg||4
